Scrolls of charging : of course. You want more than 3 wishes.
Ring of SD : Of course. You're a Vampire.
Wallet : always nice.
SDSM : always great.

Don't forget about MR (GDSM/cloak).
medecine bag is always nice for early game vampires (keeps your level  
low). especially if you have means of blessing.
Blessed figurine of a Solar is always 80% very good news (and will save  
you from teleporting out of the shop, too :-) )
Magic whistle (to go with said figurine if you have no means of getting  
one (ie whistle + poiton of GL).
spellbook of identify : you're probably too low level to use it right now  
(maybe with helm of B. + robe of P. but I'm not sure), a couple blessed  
scrolls of identify might be better.

Cursed or blessed scrolls of genocides are always popular.
